# My Favorite Series: Avatar: The Last Airbender

![Poster](https://example.com/poster.jpg)

## Overview
*Avatar: The Last Airbender* follows **Aang**, the last Airbender, as he learns to master all four elements and **stop the Fire Nation**.

## Main Characters
- Aang
- Katara
- Sokka
- Toph

## Why I Love It
1. Great character development
2. Memorable soundtrack
3. A strong message about balance and friendship

